<p>You are so infused with sunlight that your body glows permanently in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 5, 7, 8, 9,</acronym> even in dark places.</p><p>Your vision and body adapt to this glow, giving you <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">18%, 36%, 46%, 54%, 60%</acronym> blindness resistance, <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 21%, 26%, 31%, 35%</acronym> light resistance, and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 19%, 24%, 27%, 30%</acronym> light affinity.</p><p>The light radius overrides your normal light if it is bigger (it does not stack).</p><p></p>